<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĕquīnus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		equus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to horses</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pecus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 7, 7</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 27, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lac,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stercus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 38, 3</span></i>
			 al.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cervix,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A. P.
					1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cauda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 2, 1, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Epod. 8, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pedes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					4, 13, 27, § 95</span></i>
			: seta, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc. 5, 21, 62</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">emptio (i. e. equorum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 7, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pullus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Sir. 23, 30</span></i>
			.</div>
